#: data/org.gnome.Gtranslator.metainfo.xml.in.in:323
#: data/org.gnome.Gtranslator.metainfo.xml.in.in:325
msgid "Daniel García Moreno"
msgstr "ᱰᱮᱱᱤᱭᱟᱞ ᱜᱟᱨᱥᱤᱭᱟ ᱢᱚᱨᱮᱱᱳ"

#: src/gtr-actions-app.c:86
msgid ""
"Translation file editing suite for localization of applications and "
"libraries."
msgstr ""
"ᱮᱯᱞᱤᱠᱮᱥᱚᱱ ᱟᱨ ᱞᱟᱭᱵᱨᱮᱨᱤ ᱠᱚ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱞᱚᱠᱟᱞᱟᱭᱡᱮᱥᱚᱱ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱛᱚᱨᱡᱚ ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱥᱟᱥᱟᱯᱲᱟᱣ ᱥᱩᱴ᱾"

#.
#. * Note to translators: put here your name and email so it will show
