msgstr "ᱚᱱᱟ ᱰᱟᱭᱨᱮᱠᱴᱚᱨᱤ ᱵᱟᱪᱷᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱨᱮ PO ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱠᱚ ᱛᱟᱦᱮᱱᱟ"

#: src/translation-memory/gtr-translation-memory-dialog.ui:60
msgid "Use only files with this name"
msgstr "ᱱᱚᱣᱟ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱥᱟᱶ ᱥᱩᱢᱩᱝ ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱠᱚ ᱵᱮᱵᱷᱟᱨ ᱢᱮ"

#: src/translation-memory/gtr-translation-memory-dialog.ui:79
msgid "_Add to Database"
msgstr "ᱰᱟᱴᱟᱵᱮᱥ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱮᱞᱮᱫ ᱢᱮ"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:5
msgid "PO directory"
msgstr "ᱯᱤ ᱳ ᱰᱟᱭᱨᱮᱠᱴᱚᱨᱤ"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:6
msgid "Directory containing PO files to add to the translation memory."
msgstr "ᱛᱚᱨᱡᱚᱢᱟ ᱢᱮᱢᱚᱨᱤ ᱨᱮ ᱥᱮᱞᱮᱫ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ PO ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱠᱚ ᱢᱮᱱᱟᱜ ᱰᱟᱭᱨᱮᱠᱴᱚᱨᱤ ᱾"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:12
msgid "Restrict search by filename"
msgstr "ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱛᱮ ᱥᱮᱸᱫᱽᱨᱟ ᱵᱟᱱᱫᱷᱟᱣ ᱢᱮ"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:13
msgid ""
"If true, only include files with a specified filename when searching the "
"translation memory."
msgstr ""
"ᱡᱩᱫᱤ ᱥᱟᱹᱨᱤ ᱠᱟᱱᱟ, ᱛᱚᱨᱡᱚᱢᱟ ᱢᱮᱢᱚᱨᱤ ᱥᱮᱸᱫᱽᱨᱟ ᱚᱠᱛᱚ ᱥᱩᱢᱩᱝ ᱢᱤᱫ ᱴᱷᱟᱹᱣᱠᱟᱹ ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ "
"ᱥᱟᱶ ᱨᱮᱫᱽ ᱠᱚ ᱥᱮᱞᱮᱫ ᱢᱮ᱾"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:20
msgid "Filename to restrict search to"
msgstr "ᱥᱮᱸᱫᱽᱨᱟ ᱞᱟᱹᱜᱤᱫ ᱯᱷᱟᱭᱤᱞ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:21
msgid ""
"Filename to which searching of the translation memory should be restricted."
msgstr "ᱯᱷᱟᱭᱤᱞ ᱧᱩᱛᱩᱢ ᱡᱟᱦᱟᱸ ᱨᱮ ᱛᱚᱨᱡᱚ ᱢᱮᱢᱚᱨᱤ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱥᱮᱸᱫᱽᱨᱟ ᱫᱚ ᱵᱟᱱᱫᱷᱟᱣ ᱞᱟᱹᱠᱛᱤᱭᱟ᱾"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:28
msgid "Maximum number of missing words"
msgstr "ᱟᱫ ᱟᱠᱟᱱ ᱟᱹᱲᱟᱹ ᱠᱚ ᱨᱮᱭᱟᱜ ᱰᱷᱮᱨ ᱮᱞ"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:29
msgid ""
"Maximum number of words that can be missing from a message displayed as a "
"match by the translation memory."
msgstr ""
"ᱛᱚᱨᱡᱚ ᱢᱮᱢᱚᱨᱤ ᱦᱚᱛᱮᱛᱮ ᱢᱮᱪ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱟᱠᱟᱱ ᱥᱟᱱᱫᱮᱥ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱰᱷᱮᱨ ᱟᱹᱲᱟᱹ ᱠᱚ ᱟᱫ "
"ᱫᱟᱲᱮᱭᱟᱜᱼᱟ᱾"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:36
msgid "Maximum difference in message length"
msgstr "ᱥᱟᱱᱫᱮᱥ ᱡᱮᱞᱮᱝ ᱨᱮ ᱰᱷᱮᱨ ᱵᱷᱮᱜᱟᱨ"

#: src/translation-memory/org.gnome.Gtranslator.plugins.translation-memory.gschema.xml.in:37
msgid ""
"Maximum difference in length between messages displayed as matches by the "
"translation memory."
msgstr ""
"ᱛᱚᱨᱡᱚ ᱢᱮᱢᱚᱨᱤ ᱦᱚᱛᱮᱛᱮ ᱢᱮᱪ ᱞᱮᱠᱟᱛᱮ ᱩᱫᱩᱜ ᱥᱟᱱᱫᱮᱥ ᱠᱚ ᱛᱟᱞᱟ ᱨᱮ ᱰᱷᱮᱨ ᱠᱷᱚᱱ ᱰᱷᱮᱨ ᱵᱮᱜᱟᱨ ᱾"
